      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855334133333
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, you've reached VeloFit. My name is Diana. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855335599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return this VeloBand Pulse. It's a piece of garbage.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 48804,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855340533332
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear you're not satisfied with the product. To make sure I understand, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855344866665
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't track my heart rate correctly. It's useless.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 48804,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855355799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thank you for clarifying. Sometimes a simple reset can fix sensor calibration. If you have the device handy, I can walk you through that now. It's a quick process.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855359666664
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, I don't have time for all that. I just want money back. I want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 48804,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855371133330
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand you'd prefer to just return it. Standard procedure for a technical claim is to attempt troubleshooting first, but let me check the policy for you. One moment please.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855376533330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 48804,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855388599996
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, thank you for your patience. I've pulled up your order and our return guidelines. It looks like our policy states that items can be returned within 10 days of delivery.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855389299996
    },
    {
      "text": "I can see here that your VeloBand was delivered just 8 days ago, so you are unfortunately outside that 10-day window. I can go ahead and process this return for you immediately. I'll send a prepaid shipping label to the email we have on file.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855401299996
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just send it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 48804,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855416966662
    },
    {
      "text": "The email has been sent. Once our warehouse receives the item, your refund will be issued back to your original payment method. Is there anything else I can assist you with?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768855418699995
